/**
 * Model Selector - Anti-Gravity Model Quota Manager
 * 
 * Reads status files and selects the best model based on remaining quota.
 * Falls back to a fallback model if all Anti-Gravity candidates are below threshold.
 * 
 * Safe to run from cron - reads from files instead of live commands.
